# Part of sys-static-lake-trio: Acuity Cavern. Uxie L50 (start_legendary_battle), fled from (Crobat outruns it):
# check_won_battle TRUE, check_did_not_capture TRUE, so "Uxie disappeared"; the field's return hides and removes
# Uxie all the same, and FLAG_CAUGHT_UXIE stays clear.
from lake-azelf.replay
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ACUITY_CAVERN 14 11 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until battle
+0 battle run
advance text
until idle
+0 assert battle scripted platinum:SPECIES_UXIE fled
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_UXIE false
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ACUITY_CAVERN_UXIE true
